 href=/developer/api-documentation/websocket><span title="Realtime & Streaming" class=categoryLinkLabel_W154>Realtime & Streaming</span></a></div><ul class=menu__list><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-3 menu__list-item"><div class=menu__list-item-collapsible><a class="categoryLink_byQd menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--active" tabindex=0 href=/developer/api-documentation/websocket><span title=Websocket class=categoryLinkLabel_W154>Websocket</span></a><button aria-label="Collapse sidebar category 'Websocket'" aria-expanded=true type=button class="clean-btn menu__caret"></button></div><ul class=menu__list><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-4 menu__list-item get api-method"><a class="menu__link menu__link--active" aria-current=page tabindex=0 href=/developer/api-documentation/v3/get-market-data-feed><span title="Market Data Feed V3" class=linkLabel_WmDU>Market Data Feed V3</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-4 menu__list-item get api-method"><a class=menu__link tabindex=0 href=/developer/api-documentation/get-market-data-feed-authorize-v3><span title="Get Market Data Feed Authorized Url V3" class=linkLabel_WmDU>Get Market Data Feed Authorized Url V3</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-4 menu__list-item get api-method"><a class=menu__link tabindex=0 href=/developer/api-documentation/get-portfolio-stream-feed><span title="Portfolio Stream Feed" class=linkLabel_WmDU>Portfolio Stream Feed</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-4 menu__list-item get api-method"><a class=menu__link tabindex=0 href=/developer/api-documentation/get-portfolio-stream-feed-authorize><span title="Get Portfolio Stream Feed Authorized Url" class=linkLabel_WmDU>Get Portfolio Stream Feed Authorized Url</span></a><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-